<A NAME="other" ID="other"></A><B>Additional Enhancements</B><A HREF="#top"><IMG SRC="up2.gif" /></A>
<HR>

Other enhancements include:
<UL>
	<LI>Multi-assignment of volume - quickly and easily select multiple products and assign weekly volumes [similar to the original multi-rating tool]</LI>
	<LI>Resetting to Work In Progress - for Programs requiring additional work before qualifying for Approval, users can reset the status to Work In Progress</LI>
	<LI>Browser Settings - accessed via a link from the Home Page under Settings, this is a quick-reference guide for the appropriate Internet Explorer settings that will insure the awayX product is performing correctly.</LI>
